title: Company equity lifecycle (self-onboarding)
order: company-admin, shareholder, stakeholder
autonumber

// --- self onboarding ---
company-admin -> company-admin: Sign up, create company
company-admin -> company-admin: Set up cap table
company-admin -> shareholder: Invite shareholder
company-admin -> stakeholder: Invite stakeholder (option grant)

// --- acceptance ---
shareholder --> company-admin: Accept holding
stakeholder --> company-admin: Accept grant

// --- grant approval ---
company-admin -> company-admin: Create equity issuance / grant
if: needs approval
  company-admin -> company-admin: Approve grant
  company-admin --> stakeholder: Grant active, vesting starts
end

// --- ongoing ---
stakeholder -> stakeholder: Track vesting
shareholder -> shareholder: View cap table & holdings

// --- transfer (self-serve) ---
shareholder -> company-admin: Initiate share transfer
company-admin -> company-admin: Approve & settle transfer
company-admin --> shareholder: Transfer complete

// --- exercise (self-serve) ---
stakeholder -> company-admin: Exercise options
company-admin -> company-admin: Process exercise & issue shares
company-admin --> stakeholder: Shares issued
